,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This was previously addressed in #69 but seems to have returned.  Playing Life in the Village 3 pack with versions:\r\nforge 43.3.2\r\ntoms_storage-1.19-1.5.9\r\nStorageDrawers-1.19-11.1.2\r\n\r\nIf I have a bank of drawers and connect an Inventory Connector and Storage Terminal, the correct number of items is displayed.  \r\n\r\nIf I connect a Drawer Controller to the bank of drawers, the terminal doubles the numbers.  Note: the controller doesn't need to be touching the Inventory Connector, it gets found via the connected inventory.\r\n\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/306/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/306/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/comments/3939478813","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/306#issuecomment-3939478813","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/306","id":3939478813,"node_id":"IC_kwDOD2xsYc7qz60d","user":{"login":"tom5454","id":20185760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTg1NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20185760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-21T20:59:10Z","updated_at":"2026-02-21T20:59:10Z","body":"Sophisticated Storage now has compat on NeoForge! (Fabric is missing the required interface)\nMy [Create Contraption Terminals](https://modrinth.com/mod/create-contraption-terminals) Addon now has the Create Vault compat fixing this issue.\n\nFor other multiblocks use the Inventory Configurator.\nSee the new mod showcase: https://youtu.be/UoIi5q8kyo8?t=114\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":{"pinned_by":{"login":"tom5454","id":20185760,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMTg1NzYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20185760?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tom5454/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"pinned_at":"2026-02-21T20:59:13Z"},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/comments/3939478813/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772/events","html_url":"https://github.com/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772","id":4980344696,"node_id":"I_kwDOD2xsYc8AAAABKNoHeA","number":772,"title":"RuntimeException: PacketContext is required (TerminalSyncManager.write) — reproducible crash on 26.2 with Polymer","user":{"login":"duztinsan","id":232255282,"node_id":"U_kgDODdfvMg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/232255282?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan","html_url":"https://github.com/duztinsan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/duztinsan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-07-26T11:35:35Z","updated_at":"2026-08-30T14:57:33Z","closed_at":"2026-08-30T14:57:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Mod version\nTom's Simple Storage Mod 2.11.2 (also happened on 2.11.1, same crash)\n\n### Environment\n- Minecraft: 26.2\n- Fabric Loader: 0.19.3\n- Fabric API: 0.155.2+26.2\n- Polymer (bundled): 0.17.3+26.2\n- Java: 25.0.3 (Eclipse Adoptium)\n\n### Description\nServer crashes with \"PacketContext is required, but it wasn't set up!\" \nwhenever I put an item INTO the Storage Terminal. The crash happens \nreliably at that exact action — inserting an item triggers \nTerminalSyncManager.write via StorageTerminalMenu.broadcastChanges, \nwhich then hits Polymer's ItemStack encoding hook \n(polymer$replaceWithVanillaItem), which requires a PacketContext \nthat isn't set up in this code path.\n\nThis is not related to Waystones or any other specific mod — it \nhappens with just Tom's Storage + Polymer (bundled) installed, \ntriggered purely by inserting an item into the terminal. Reproducible \nin a fresh world with no other player interaction needed.\n\nRelated to #767 — that report showed a different but related NPE \nin TerminalSyncManager.read after updating from 2.9.1 to 2.9.2, also \nblaming Polymer's ItemStack encoding hook. Seems like the same root \ncause (TerminalSyncManager syncing outside the normal packet/network \npath, so Polymer's PacketContext scoped value is never set), just \nsurfacing as different exceptions depending on version.\n\n### Stacktrace\njava.lang.RuntimeException: PacketContext is required, but it wasn't set up!\n\tat knot//net.fabricmc.fabric.api.networking.v1.context.PacketContext.lambda$orElseThrow$1(PacketContext.java:148)\n\tat java.base/java.lang.ScopedValue.orElseThrow(Unknown Source)\n\tat knot//net.fabricmc.fabric.api.networking.v1.context.PacketContext.orElseThrow(PacketContext.java:148)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack$1.localvar$deh000$polymer-core$polymer$replaceWithVanillaItem(ItemStack.java:525)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack$1.encode(ItemStack.java)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack$1.encode(ItemStack.java:143)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack$2.encode(ItemStack.java:185)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.item.ItemStack$2.encode(ItemStack.java:170)\n\tat knot//com.tom.storagemod.util.TerminalSyncManager.write(TerminalSyncManager.java:66)\n\tat knot//com.tom.storagemod.util.TerminalSyncManager.update(TerminalSyncManager.java:138)\n\tat knot//com.tom.storagemod.menu.StorageTerminalMenu.broadcastChanges(StorageTerminalMenu.java:223)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.server.level.ServerPlayer.tick(ServerPlayer.java:662)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.server.level.ServerLevel.tickNonPassenger(ServerLevel.java:851)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.level.Level.guardEntityTick(Level.java:493)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.server.level.ServerLevel.lambda$tick$0(ServerLevel.java:448)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.world.level.entity.EntityTickList.forEach(EntityTickList.java:53)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.server.level.ServerLevel.tick(ServerLevel.java:418)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.server.MinecraftServer.tickChildren(MinecraftServer.java:1137)\n\tat knot//net.minecraft.server.MinecraftServer.tickServer(MinecraftServer.java:1001)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n1. Install Tom's Storage 2.11.2 + Polymer (bundled) 0.17.3 on Fabric 26.2\n2. Place a Storage Terminal connected to an Inventory Connector\n3. Open the terminal, put an item into it\n4. Server immediately throws the RuntimeException above","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/772/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/165","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/165/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tom5454/Toms-Storage/issues/165/com